From: NovaRocks fixture maintainers
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Backport storage-table support to the Iceberg 1.10.1 REST fixture

Source: https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/9830
Upstream-Commit: bb460f9a9493ceef13d10b6afbf0ee677b8f3a37
Base-Commit: ccb8bc435062171e64bc8b7e5f56e6aed9c5b934
Contract: https://github.com/apache/iceberg/blob/f14886bb4c54d3e292df85161a0250fbb9ae6d12/format/view-spec.md

Only the six service-side classes and ViewVersion parser tests are backported.
The parser uses the 1.10.1 JsonUtil.getStringArray(JsonUtil.get(...)) form.
No refresh-state or Spark changes are included.

